Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Legal, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Trade Sales (links to VS-11), Sustainability (links to VS-25), executives attending industry forums
Source: workflow W3957 — Association, Trade-Body &amp; Competitor-Interaction Risk Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
