      <bpmn:userTask id="W3957_Task4" name="Legal/Govt-Affairs inventory all association memberships, trade bodies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Govt-Affairs inventory all association memberships, trade bodies, standard-setting bodies, and coalition activity BuildRight participates in (links to VS-104.2), and identify which involve competitor interaction (industry councils, benchmarking groups, joint purchasing, joint advocacy)
Responsible (R): Legal / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3957_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3957_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3957_Task5" name="Legal assess the antitrust risk of each forum: information-exchange risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal assess the antitrust risk of each forum: information-exchange risk (prices, costs, margins, output, territories, customers), standard-setting exclusion risk, joint-purchasing/buyer-power risk, and joint-advocacy crossing into concerted action
Responsible (R): Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3957_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3957_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3957_Task6" name="Legal issue the association-meeting compliance protocol (links to W3965) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal issue the association-meeting compliance protocol (links to W3965) and the antitrust guardrails already referenced across VS-104.1/VS-104.2; brief BuildRight representatives attending forums
Responsible (R): Legal / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3957_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3957_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
