    <bpmn:process id="W_W3958" name="W3958. Procurement, Buyer-Power &amp; Supplier-Coordination Risk Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk review; major sourcing initiative; cooperative buying change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: ~PHP 37B annual procurement spend; cooperative/community programs
Owner: VP Legal / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Legal, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Supply Chain (links to VS-02), Cooperative Sourcing (links to VS-94), Commodity (links to VS-106)
Source: workflow W3958 — Procurement, Buyer-Power &amp; Supplier-Coordination Risk Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3958_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3958_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3958_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3958_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3958_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3958_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3958_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3958_Start3" name="Annual risk review; major sourcing initiative; cooperative buying change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3958_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3958_Task4" name="Legal/Procurement assess buyer-power risk: BuildRight&#x27;s bargaining leverage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Procurement assess buyer-power risk: BuildRight&#x27;s bargaining leverage over ~1,000 suppliers (top 20 = 45% of COGS), and conduct that could constitute abuse of superior bargaining position or exclusionary dealing (imposed discounts, most-favored-supplier, retroactive terms, tying of unrelated purchases)
Responsible (R): Legal / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3958_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3958_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3958_Task5" name="Legal assess joint/cooperative purchasing risk (VS-94 cooperative/community…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal assess joint/cooperative purchasing risk (VS-94 cooperative/community procurement, and any buying-group/consortium), supplier-coordination risk (VS-106 commodity hedging/indexed pricing across shared suppliers), and information-sharing with other buyers
Responsible (R): Legal / Procurement / Cooperative Sourcing
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3958_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3958_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3958_Task6" name="Legal issue control requirements into procurement conduct controls (W3966) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal issue control requirements into procurement conduct controls (W3966) and supplier-agreement review (W3962); refresh on sourcing-strategy change
Responsible (R): Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3958_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3958_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3958_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3958_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
