    <bpmn:process id="W_W3959" name="W3959. Digital, Marketplace &amp; Platform Competition Risk Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk review; marketplace/retail-media change; platform feature change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Marketplace (VS-95), retail media (VS-48), ecommerce (VS-10), app (VS-75)
Owner: VP Legal / Head of Digital Commerce
Participants: Legal, Ecommerce/Digital Commerce Inc. (links to VS-10), Marketplace Ops (links to VS-95), Retail Media (links to VS-48), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), IT (links to VS-27/VS-113)
Source: workflow W3959 — Digital, Marketplace &amp; Platform Competition Risk Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3959_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3959_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3959_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3959_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3959_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3959_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3959_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3959_Start3" name="Annual risk review; marketplace/retail-media change; platform feature change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3959_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3959_Task4" name="Legal/Digital assess platform-conduct risk where BuildRight operates as both…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Digital assess platform-conduct risk where BuildRight operates as both retailer and marketplace operator (VS-95): self-preferencing, use of third-party-seller data, parity clauses, tying of retail-media buy (VS-48) to placement, and most-favored-nation pricing across channels
Responsible (R): Legal / Marketplace Ops / Retail Media
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Head Digital Commerce
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3959_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3959_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3959_Task5" name="Legal assess data/algorithmic-pricing risk: use of competitively sensitive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal assess data/algorithmic-pricing risk: use of competitively sensitive data, algorithmic collusion risk (shared pricing engines/benchmarks), and cross-use of seller/customer data (with privacy limits per VS-91)
Responsible (R): Legal / IT / Data Privacy
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3959_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3959_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3959_Task6" name="Legal issue platform-conduct controls into W3961/W3962/W3968; monitor global…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal issue platform-conduct controls into W3961/W3962/W3968; monitor global platform-regulation trends (digital-markets regimes) for PCC adoption
Responsible (R): Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3959_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3959_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3959_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3959_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
