        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-617 (ensure controlled execution — Competition Risk Assessment, Market Power &amp; Exposure Analysis (PA-129.1).) | - CTL-159 (ensure competition-law conduct.) | - operational: transparent ranking and data-use controls; operational: engine independence and review
Owner: VP Legal / Head of Digital Commerce</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
