    <bpmn:process id="W_W3960" name="W3960. Competition Law Training, Awareness &amp; Culture Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual training cycle; risk-assessment findings (W3953–W3959); incident lessons
Frequency: Annual + on onboarding/role change
Volume: ~6,918 employees; risk-role-targeted cohorts
Owner: VP Legal / L&amp;D
Participants: Legal, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), HR (links to VS-103), Compliance (links to VS-119), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), executives
Source: workflow W3960 — Competition Law Training, Awareness &amp; Culture Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3960_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3960_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3960_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3960_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3960_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3960_Lane2" name="L&amp;D">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3960_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3960_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3960_Start4" name="Annual training cycle; risk-assessment findings (W3953–W3959); incident lessons">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3960_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3960_Task5" name="Legal/L&amp;D design tiered competition-law training: (a) all-employee awareness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/L&amp;D design tiered competition-law training: (a) all-employee awareness (do&#x27;s/don&#x27;ts, speak-up links to VS-119); (b) risk-role modules for Merchandising/Pricing, Procurement, Trade/B2B Sales, Govt Affairs/association attendees, and Corp Dev/M&amp;A — covering price-fixing, RPM, exclusivity, info-exchange, abuse of dominance, and merger notification; (c) executive/board briefing
Responsible (R): Legal / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3960_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3960_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3960_Task6" name="Legal/L&amp;D deliver training via OLA (links to VS-19.4), embed competition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/L&amp;D deliver training via OLA (links to VS-19.4), embed competition scenarios into role onboarding (links to VS-121/VS-123), and track completion by risk role with attestation
Responsible (R): L&amp;D / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3960_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3960_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3960_Task7" name="Legal/Compliance reinforce culture through communications (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Compliance reinforce culture through communications (links to VS-63/VS-103.1), refresh for regulatory changes and incident lessons (links to W3970–W3976), and measure effectiveness via knowledge checks and behavior indicators
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3960_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3960_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3960_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3960_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3960_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-617 (ensure controlled execution — Competition Risk Assessment, Market Power &amp; Exposure Analysis (PA-129.1).) | - operational: role-targeted scenarios and attestation; operational: risk-role register and tracking
Owner: VP Legal / L&amp;D</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
